tter_-_Landscape_-_2026-04-16T091059.692.jpg","image_focal_point":null,"image_alt_text":"Tim Johnston - 2025-26 NJCAA Sports Information Director of the Year","video":null,"url":"/news/2026/4/15/general-congratulations-tim-johnston-named-2026-njcaa-sid-of-the-year.aspx","redirect_absolute_url":null,"links":null,"homepage_feed_template":"story_links","game_id":null,"games":[],"gallery_id":0,"writer":null,"ranking":10,"locked_ranking":false,"id":1041,"content_id":"1041","content_title":"Congratulations, Tim! Johnston Named 2026 NJCAA SID of the Year","content_date":"2026-04-15T21:41:00","content_url":"https://macombmonarchs.com/news/2026/4/15/general-congratulations-tim-johnston-named-2026-njcaa-sid-of-the-year.aspx","content_image_url":"https://macombmonarchs.com/images/2026/4/16/Jersey_Series_-_Quick_Hitter_-_Landscape_-_2026-04-16T091059.692.jpg","date":"2026-04-15T21:41:00"},{"title":"Macomb Athletics Welcomes Hunter Chovanec as Athletic Communications Assistant","title_in_rotator":true,"sub_headline":"With stops at NCAA Division I and Division II athletic communications departments, Chovanec brings a wealth of experience to Macomb.","teaser":"<strong>WARREN, Mich. –</strong> Macomb Community College Athletics announced the appointment of <strong><dfn><a href=\"/staff-directory/hunter-chovanec/110\" rel=\"smarttag\" rev=\"110\">Hunter Chovanec</a></dfn> </strong>as its new Athletic Communications Assistant on Friday (Aug. 15). Bringing a wealth of experience in athletic communications across NCAA Division I, II, and NAIA levels, Chovanec will assist with all aspects of athletic communications at Macomb.","type":null,"byline":null,"app_exclusive":false,"sport_display":"General","sport":{"id":2,"title":"General","abbreviation":"GEN","shortname":"general","short_title":"","global_sport_id":null,"non_sport":false,"show_at_vs":false,"global_sport_shortname":"general","gender":"g","youtube":"PLBZXhBju0buvidMz_OuzuaMuuTf14enJg","facebook":"www.Facebook.com/MacombAthletic